{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Comprehensive Contest Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Town A is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles to town B. If a car travels from town A to town B at an average speed of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour and returns to A at an average speed of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles per hour, then the average speed for the trip is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/a/07aa914d7d38366983e7128030e9c0e039d72422.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(1)} \\quad \\text{never} \\quad \\text{(2)} \\quad \\text{always} \\quad \\text{(3)} \\quad \\text{when } a = 0 \\quad \\text{(4)} \\quad \\text{when } ac + bd = 0 \\quad \\text{(5) when } ad + bc = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"686\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/f/3dfb6e5e1c6f90c444b663399245af3fcb958f24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a + b)(c + d) = ac + bc + ad + bd = (ac + bd) + (ad + bc) = ac + bd$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"540\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>From what we have, we can notice that this would only be true when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/8/5686907c067dbb1ef2125c532558649e4ed618dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(5) } \\text{when } ad + bc = 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"178\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Comprehensive Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Comprehensive Contest Problem 17 (page does not exist)\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Comprehensive_Contest_Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Comprehensive Contest Problem 19 (page does not exist)\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041731\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 59/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 664/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 308/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1337/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.747      1 Template:Succession_box\n100.00%    7.747      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36277:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018041731 and revision id 281159. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}